    {
      "technique": "technique/toss",
      "works_on": ["ingredient/celeriac", "ingredient/lemon", "ingredient/salt"],
      "text": "Toss the strips at once with the juice of the lemon and the salt, so that they stay white. Leave them to soften a little.",
