      "works_on": ["preparation/mayonnaise", "ingredient/dijon-mustard"],
      "text": "Whisk the mustard into the mayonnaise. It should taste sharp.",
      "time": null,
      "temperature": null,
      "safety_points": []
    },
    {
      "technique": "technique/toss",
      "works_on": ["ingredient/celeriac", "preparation/mayonnaise"],
      "text": "Drain off any liquid and fold the sauce through the celeriac until every strip is coated. Taste and adjust. It is better after a short rest in the fridge.",
